WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.205
Acronyms use initial letters of words; playful language depends on audience and

00:00:05.205 --> 00:00:08.541
context. Use formal language where precision is important.

00:00:09.367 --> 00:00:14.411
What do the letters in an acronym usually stand for? Answer: Parts of a longer name

00:00:14.411 --> 00:00:15.041
or phrase

00:00:15.867 --> 00:00:20.869
Create an original acronym for a school group and explain it; rewrite an informal

00:00:20.869 --> 00:00:21.584
message formally.

00:00:22.450 --> 00:00:25.181
Acronyms are built from initial letters of words.
